# OPTIONAL. The standalone dashboard is served by dashboard-server.mjs on the
# same origin, so the dashboard uses relative /api/... paths by default and you
# normally do NOT need this. Only set it if you run the dashboard through its
# own Vite dev server (hot-reload while editing UI) and want it to reach the
# data server on a different port, e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:4000
